# VHS M1 hidden and shown again (X-Background=run): the camera is released while hidden (nothing drawn) and
# opened again on show (brief 3.3 rule 5; the recording part of section 13 comes with M3 / M6).
title VHS hidden and shown again (X-Background=run): the camera released and reopened
sizes 800x480
lifecycle
env VHS_FAKE 1
env VHS_SOC bcm2837
env VHS_FORMAT rgb565

wait 1500
shot 01-live
expect text "1920x1080  30 fps"
hide
wait 800
expect hidden
expect nowrite
show
wait 1500
expect visible
expect repaint
shot 02-shown
expect text "1920x1080  30 fps"
key esc
expect quit
